#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:21 f0a021428c5f40c19b5bfd22c3a551ac
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectPanner uses a custom DSP to distribute the first two input channels between "
"the left and right output channels. Additional channels pass through unchanged."
msgstr "FmodAudioEffectPanner 使用自定义 DSP，将前两个输入声道分配到左右输出声道，其他声道保持不变。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:23 febfb2874a164854b3d5cb7de2e929a4
msgid ""
"A pan value of 0.0 preserves the original left and right signals. Negative values move the "
"signal toward the left output, while positive values move it toward the right output. Stereo "
"input is not summed to mono at the center position."
msgstr "声像为 0.0 时保留原始左右声道信号。负值将信号移向左输出，正值将信号移向右输出。位于中央时不会将立体声输入合并为单声道。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectpanner.rst:73 a9d41593038e4afd95ac44ca3979137e
msgid ""
"The pan position, clamped to -1.0 through 1.0. The default 0.0 preserves the input stereo "
"image. At -1.0 the two input channels are summed into the left output, and at 1.0 they are "
"summed into the right output."
msgstr "声像位置，限制在 -1.0 到 1.0。默认值 0.0 保留输入的立体声声像。-1.0 将两个输入声道相加送到左输出，1.0 将其相加送到右输出。"
